┼ exactly one · ○&amp;lt; zero or many · ┼&amp;lt; one or many · ○┼ zero or one&lt;br&gt;EXCHANGE_RATE joins PRICE_OBSERVATION by month (obs_month = rate_month) in fn_price_usd.&lt;br&gt;AUDIT_LOG has no FK on purpose: it keeps entries for deleted rows.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours&lt;/b&gt;: blue = location · green = prices · yellow = commodities · red = alert rules and audit" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#fafafa;spacing=8;rounded=1;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="800" width="560" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>